## Frequently asked questions

**How long does SEO take?**

Local SEO typically shows meaningful results within 3–6 months, though many clients see improvements within the first 4–8 weeks.

**Do I need a new website first?**

Not always — we can improve SEO on your existing site. But a well-built [Newport website](/web-design-newport/) makes a big difference to how well your SEO performs.

**Can you guarantee rankings?**

No ethical SEO agency can guarantee specific rankings. We can guarantee we'll do the right things to improve them.

**Do you work outside Newport?**

Yes — we cover [South Wales](/seo-south-wales/) including [Cardiff](/seo-cardiff/), [Swansea](/seo-swansea/), [Bridgend](/seo-bridgend/), and [Merthyr Tydfil](/seo-merthyr-tydfil/).

